": "38347751224815589", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620965_38347751238148921_5057248519300288108_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SOb8W59rhYkQ7kNvwHtj9y-&_nc_oc=AdrrHDEy_J-FNCVU8bAaAmvcWjoGnhQ33dC0B8s36pWzvnhBYMX8RxQmARtStumVmRM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLeZqOiH2COA4IWkv1OP80WrPGbBsDggQiDGt5_MjlPhQ&oe=6AA2C297"}, {"file_name": "cap_shot2-lane_1.png", "id": "1344809297858874", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604282317_1344809301192207_4447666598631232526_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=20yNhQJJKz8Q7kNvwGI-cCZ&_nc_oc=AdqeAA3kcE2rdxevX8iVHT_s7y2R9Gx05DYqxdhjN3E-uUY9xm0_GMmXE77buYA5S6g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJWFG3T7p5efr0kShZRw0TtdKAO_fRHeIHa9pjGhLpPBw&oe=6AA2CC8B"}, {"file_name": "cap_shot3-depth-alt_1.png", "id": "1040915801870464", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623400_1040915808537130_4781429846582066514_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NrZxBiNx1WsQ7kNvwGNpfnY&_nc_oc=AdrXEcZw0GxSQ1528liLmhhD4cQU3d5WClF1Atsa7ZXZDB_gnhN1qI6XlwvB4PV5fpo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI1P8x-uDaFx4nWRz1LWg0VUXfTh88buJt1DCsSBX9WMA&oe=6AA2CD8E"}, {"file_name": "cap_shot4-score_1.png", "id": "27554383440855653", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499624983_27554383447522319_1875656870862086556_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uSTGspm_EvAQ7kNvwFR8Kpl&_nc_oc=Adp4WU2N3NYMyDmgpyUdqyLMXtRtorTwjzwvBwkPe0YSKcq7oi0p__mvvBZlH4miWuU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQItk5-d8IqXrrleIIHHCvCwNMuZvirWeus6_v-myBD0bQ&oe=6AA2B6B6"}, {"file_name": "cap_shot5-rest_1.png", "id": "1706333930584924", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622211_1706333933918257_8714833817623575886_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=onZ2sTAv6OEQ7kNvwHP74Sr&_nc_oc=AdpUQFxLAYdsRvxy5jMVSg5zbHjaoAYuTRev7CcHuvxr-qBVsw53Z3CSUU3Kb6Jw2Ms&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ08OULpyecGS93Zc5Ssra5XraejgaVbQ0bkLy_iDaJLw&oe=6AA2C294"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "AxeArcade_trailer_cover.png", "id": "1061070172992027", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604282317_1061070176325360_7984314788343204879_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZYCwkNlwImgQ7kNvwH57muj&_nc_oc=Adpo5keUKEn7RbEEBfOb1P3-FwAF3wLkfF3Uoe5vyGn2T_5071LJgHEoxlLbvCndp5o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJH8H8bckwgBV-l1eRh6jLuTHZ9FQxc303Ocf7qmBpQ1A&oe=6AA29F93"}, "display_name": "Axe Arcade", "keywords": ["axe", "throwing", "arcade", "bullseye", "casual"], "long_description": "**How good is your throw?**\n\nPick up an axe with a natural grip, feel its weight as you wind up, and send it spinning end-over-end into the board. Every throw is pure physics and timing \u2014 nail the bullseye for the big score and chase a higher total round after round.\n\n## What you do\n- Grab the axe anywhere on the handle \u2014 grip button, either hand.\n- Wind up and release with a real throwing motion; the axe flies the way you throw it.\n- Hit the target board \u2014 the closer to the bullseye, the bigger the score.\n- Ten throws a round. Beat your high score.\n\n## Pick your challenge\n- Four difficulty tiers: EASY, NORMAL, VIKING and BERSERKER.\n- Two venues to throw in \u2014 the Training Field and Fjord Lane.\n- Fjord Lane adds a distance ladder: land a scoring hit and the board steps farther away.\n- Leaderboards for your best rounds.\n\n## Built for comfort\n- Play seated or standing \u2014 everything is within arm's reach.\n- No artificial movement, no smooth turning, no vection. Comfortable rating.\n- Simple to learn, satisfying to master.", "short_description": "Grab an axe, wind up, and let it fly \u2014 sink bullseyes and climb the high-sco